Z||000012||Songman||06-12-2001||11:01 PM||||AD3 is the RPO for a sunroof. He just typed in A03 instead. There is no A03 code... All Indys had sunroofs.<P>If anyone is interested in checking some of their codes, here is a page with a nice list..<P>Aus, I could be wrong but I don't think any of the street pace cars came with the roof scoop. I think they were all added later. Like I say, I could be wrong but I don't find an RPO for it either.<BR> <A HREF="http://fiero2m4.homestead.com/RPOlist.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero2m4.homestead.com/RPOlist.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 06-12-2001).]||||reg||1
